-- The agreements' root (MMS-521): every collective agreement that speaks to
-- an item of the shared vocabulary (l4/lib/vocabulary.l4), registered once
-- as an instrument, and what it claims for a case. The root
-- (l4/lib/root.l4) imports it beside the takanon's and the circulars' roots
-- and leaves precedence to l4/lib/precedence.l4.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT vocabulary
IMPORT precedence
IMPORT terms
IMPORT `2008-01-24_oz-latmura_tosefet-sachar_reform-model`

§ `שורש ההסכמים — מה ההסכמים אומרים על כל פריט`

§§ `תוספת 2008`

`the agreement of 24.1.2008` MEANS
    `instrument` WITH
        `module`        IS "2008-01-24_oz-latmura_tosefet-sachar_reform-model"
        `title`         IS "ההסכם הקיבוצי מיום 24.1.2008, סעיף 4"
        `kind`          IS `a collective agreement`
        `is the takanon` IS FALSE
        `issued`        IS DATE_FROM_DMY 24 1 2008
        `practised for all state employees` IS FALSE
        `approved by the Finance Minister`  IS FALSE

GIVEN c IS A `2008 supplement case`
GIVETH A LIST OF `claim`
DECIDE `the agreements' claims on the 2008 supplement` c IS
    catMaybes (LIST `the claim of` `the agreement of 24.1.2008` (`the 2008 supplement according to the agreement of 24.1.2008` c))

-- Every instrument this root registers, for the root's report.
`the agreements' instruments` MEANS LIST `the agreement of 24.1.2008`
